      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:121",
        "answer": "Builds a featured-item header, interact prompt, party-leader prompt and double-XP icons. A nonnil name is localized-if-hash then uppercased. ShowForAllClients controls party-leader visibility and small controls parent state. Session/lobby/model callbacks validate them; LastInput on PC hides the interact prompt for KBM and shows it for gamepad. Creates self via LUI.UIElement.new, GamemodeBackground via LUI.UIImage.new, NotFocused via LUI.UIImage.new, Header via LUI.UIText.new, DirectorFeatureInteractPrompt via CoD.DirectorFeatureInteractPrompt.new, PartyLeaderOnlyPrompt via CoD.DirectorPartyLeaderOnlyPrompt.new, DoubleXPCardIconsRightAligned via CoD.DoubleXPCardIconsRightAligned.new, FrontendFrameSelected via LUI.UIImage.new. Stores state predicates Invisible, Small; their body effects require state-system evaluation.",
